        },
        {
          "id": "AC-004",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "`wireframe.py` 退出正式流程，不再作为平行入口与 `prototype` 竞争语义。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260420T161102Z-f6d1",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-20T16:11:37.569593+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:docs/beacon/v1.3.5/user-story/beacon-v1.3.5-prototype-wireframe-mode-and-prototype-surface-refactor.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-005",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "wireframe 包可独立冻结页面清单、页面职责、路由关系、状态说明，不依赖 HTML 页面。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260420T161102Z-f6d1",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-20T16:11:37.569593+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:docs/beacon/v1.3.5/user-story/beacon-v1.3.5-prototype-wireframe-mode-and-prototype-surface-refactor.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-006",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "每个页面都可追溯到 PRD 承诺、user story 与 test-case 场景，满足 requirement-driven 闭环。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260420T161102Z-f6d1",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-20T16:11:37.569593+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
          "story_id": "",
          "details": [],
          "source": "user-story:docs/beacon/v1.3.5/user-story/beacon-v1.3.5-prototype-wireframe-mode-and-prototype-surface-refactor.md"
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-007",
          "kind": "ac",
          "theme": "general",
          "text": "`v1.3.5` 输出只负责结构冻结，不反向篡改 `v1.3.6` 产品定义，且可被下游直接消费。",
          "required": true,
          "status": "accepted",
          "implemented_by_run_id": "run-20260420T161102Z-f6d1",
          "verified_by_run_id": "review.accept",
          "accepted_at": "2026-04-20T16:11:37.569593+00:00",
          "changed_in_revision": "R1",
